  "blocks": [
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "before i get into my bullshit about the ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "2003 music video for red hot chili peppers' single \"can't stop\"",
          "marks": {},
          "link": {
            "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8DyziWtkfBw",
            "record": null
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": ", a disclaimer: my childhood doesn't come with many positive experiences, but one of the few was how my dad (unserious, cultured, immature king) would call me into the house from playing outside because there was a music video on vh1 that he needed me to watch. the one time i didn't want to come inside to watch 'billy jean' for the 100th time is probably the most disappointed he's ever been with me. even though his second wife (demon, cultureless, fake red head) banned mtv from the entire house, he'd sneak in episodes of beavis and butthead and let me watch. when i got a place of my own, i paid for premium cable",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " just for mtv classic",
          "marks": {
            "italic": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": ". this is all to explain why i believe that ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "the most important art form that my generation made mainstream is the music video",
          "marks": {
            "bold": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": ". i don't want any of you ghouls questioning me writing about music videos in ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "my",
          "marks": {
            "italic": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " little art blog.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "one of my endeavors this year is to learn video editing and, while i'm not making them yet, music videos are my biggest inspirations for editing short form content. \"can't stop\" played at the gym the other day and it reminded me of the quick-cutting performance art pieces the band did. ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "embed",
      "href": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/8DyziWtkfBw?rel=0&hl=en-US",
      "embedUrl": "https://www.youtube.com/embed/8DyziWtkfBw?rel=0&hl=en-US",
      "youtube": {
        "videoId": "8DyziWtkfBw",
        "start": null
      },
      "height": null,
      "aspectRatio": null
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "it was the scenes with the band altogether playing that especially made me feel something, because it seemed like they were all having fun. this is an important thing to convey if you're going to capture ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "my",
          "marks": {
            "italic": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " heart, it's the same reason ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "van halen's jump",
          "marks": {},
          "link": {
            "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=SwYN7mTi6HM",
            "record": null
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": " is one of my all time favorite music videos. another one of my top 5 favorite music videos is ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "michael and janet jackson's \"scream\"",
          "marks": {},
          "link": {
            "href": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=0P4A1K4lXDo",
            "record": null
          }
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": ". now, would you believe me if i told you that ",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "scream ",
          "marks": {
            "italic": true
          },
          "link": null
        },
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "was directed by mark romanek, the director of \"can't stop\"? weeweewowow.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "align": null,
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "content": [
        {
          "kind": "text",
          "text": "i had an edible tonight so here are the distinct scenes from the music video in order of when i noticed it.",
          "marks": {},
          "link": null
        }
